":"Pleasant water","Arena amplia":"Wide sandy beach","Arena estrecha":"Narrow sandy beach","Sombra natural":"Natural shade","Poca sombra":"Little shade","Buen lugar para niños":"Good for children","No es ideal para niños pequeños":"Not ideal for small children","Buen lugar para correr":"Good for running","Buen lugar para andar en bicicleta":"Good for cycling","Buen lugar para caminar":"Good for walking","Buen lugar para ver el atardecer":"Good for sunset","Buen lugar para fotos":"Great for photos","Más tranquilo por la mañana":"Quieter in the morning","Más animado por la tarde":"Livelier in the afternoon","Más movimiento por la noche":"Busier at night","Mucho movimiento":"Very busy","Poco movimiento":"Less busy","Ambiente bohemio":"Bohemian atmosphere","Ambiente sofisticado":"Upscale atmosphere","Ambiente relajado":"Relaxed atmosphere","Ambiente deportivo":"Sporty atmosphere","Ambiente cultural":"Cultural atmosphere","Ambiente histórico":"Historic atmosphere","Zona residencial":"Residential area","Zona comercial":"Commercial area","Zona gastronómica":"Dining area","Zona bohemia":"Bohemian area","Zona de playa":"Beach area","Zona de hoteles":"Hotel area","Buena conexión de transporte":"Good transportation links","Fácil de recorrer a pie":"Easy to explore on foot","Mejor moverse en metro":"Best to get around by metro","Mejor moverse en Uber":"Best to get around by Uber","Mejor ir en transporte privado":"Best reached by private transportation","Evita ir en auto":"Avoid going by car","Estacionar puede ser difícil":"Parking can be difficult","Hay estacionamiento":"Parking available","No hay estacionamiento":"No parking available","Entrada por orden de llegada":"First come, first served","Aforo limitado":"Limited capacity","Sin límite de edad":"No age limit","No apto para todas las edades":"Not suitable for all ages","Se necesita buena condición física":"Good fitness is required","No se necesita experiencia":"No experience required","No necesitas saber nadar":"You don't need to know how to swim","Debes saber nadar":"You must know how to swim","Actividad acompañada":"Accompanied activity","Actividad guiada":"Guided activity","Equipo incluido":"Equipment included","Transporte incluido":"Transportation included","Hotel pickup":"Hotel pickup","Confirmación por WhatsApp":"Confirmation via WhatsApp","Reserva por WhatsApp":"Book via WhatsApp","Consulta por WhatsApp":"Ask via WhatsApp","Descubre Río de Janeiro con Ernestinho Carioca: atracciones, playas, museos, gastronomía, transporte, consejos y experiencias para organizar tu viaje.":"Discover Rio de Janeiro with Ernestinho Carioca: attractions, beaches, museums, food, transportation, tips and experiences to plan your trip.","Ernestinho Carioca | Río desde mi mirada":"Ernestinho Carioca | Rio through my eyes","La guía de Río de Janeiro con información práctica, lugares para conocer y experiencias para reservar.":"Your Rio de Janeiro guide with practical information, places to discover and experiences to book.","Atracciones, playas, transporte, consejos y experiencias en Río de Janeiro.":"Attractions, beaches, transportation, tips and experiences in Rio de Janeiro.","Carnaval, Réveillon, Rock in Rio y las fechas que transforman la ciudad.":"Carnival, Réveillon, Rock in Rio and the dates that transform the city.","Rodizio tradicional desde 1951, a pocos pasos del Copacabana Palace.":"Traditional rodízio since 1951, just steps from Copacabana Palace.","Boteco clásico con mostrador repleto de mariscos, tapas y cerveza fría.":"Classic boteco with a counter full of seafood, snacks and cold beer.","Tradicionales sándwiches de pernil con piña y atención hasta tarde.":"Traditional roast-pork sandwiches with pineapple, served until late.","Cocina árabe, mezze, carnes y opciones vegetarianas cerca de la playa.":"Arab cuisine, mezze, meats and vegetarian options near the beach.","Desayuno y dulces dentro del Forte de Copacabana con vista al mar.":"Breakfast and sweets inside Forte de Copacabana with an ocean view.","Cocina japonesa contemporánea con sushi, pescados y presentaciones modernas.":"Contemporary Japanese cuisine with sushi, fish and modern presentation.","Bohemia de Leblon, platos brasileños y cocina que acompaña la noche.":"Leblon nightlife, Brazilian dishes and food made for a night out.","Carnes servidas con una secuencia de guarniciones a la mesa.":"Meats served with a sequence of side dishes at the table.","Rodizio de carnes con una de las vistas más famosas de la ciudad.":"Meat rodízio with one of the city's most famous views.","Cocina vegetal creativa para quienes buscan una experiencia sin carne.":"Creative plant-based cuisine for those looking for a meat-free experience.","Uno de los bares más antiguos de Río, con tradición cervecera y cocina alemana.":"One of Rio's oldest bars, with a brewing tradition and German cuisine.","Pescados, camarones y la tradicional traíra sin espinas.":"Fish, shrimp and the traditional boneless traíra.","Ambiente frente al mar con cocina variada y buenos desayunos.":"Oceanfront atmosphere with varied cuisine and good breakfasts.","Famoso por la costilla, los petiscos abundantes y el ambiente de barrio.":"Known for ribs, generous snacks and a neighborhood atmosphere.","Boteco premiado con bolinhos, sándwiches y recetas llenas de personalidad.":"Award-winning boteco with croquettes, sandwiches and recipes full of personality.","Mariscos y cocina brasileña con paisaje de manglar y Restinga da Marambaia.":"Seafood and Brazilian cuisine with mangrove scenery and views of Restinga da Marambaia.","Comer en la mureta mirando la bahía es una experiencia esencialmente carioca.":"Eating on the seawall while looking at the bay is a quintessential Carioca experience.","Cocina brasileña y jardines con vistas panorámicas sobre la ciudad.":"Brazilian cuisine and gardens with panoramic views over the city.","Restaurante del Copacabana Palace junto a la piscina,